Outline scalar scheduling from the common VU1 chain frame.
Preserves scalar issue order and timing; no generator or arithmetic changes.
Five preserved-binary replay pairs reduced isolated cost by 4.62%; not an FPS claim.
Integration: fix-chore patch 72-vu1-scalar-outline, regenerated on the PR 26 chain (same change, new context).

